  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong conjuration <strong>CL</strong> 13th; <strong>Cost</strong> 10,000 GP<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> — <strong>Weight</strong> 1/2&nbsp;lb.<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nYou cease to age for 13 years after you eat this gleaming golden apple. During that time, all spells you are subject to when you have no other spells upon you have their durations extended, as if with the Extend Spell feat.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\n5,750 gp; Craft Wondrous Item, Extend Spell, greater age resistance<sup>UM</sup>, limited wish</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-magic-items#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
